{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51730","headline":"夏雨登干霄亭上宋使君（二首） 一 · 贯休","name":"夏雨登干霄亭上宋使君（二首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霁色澄鲜壑映红，干霄亭上望无穷。\n蝉惊残雨疑秋蚤，雷傍严城报岁丰。\n归庙片云衔紫电，立查双鹤唳仙风。\n自怜四郡干戈日，得在文翁教化中。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}